==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|runs aground|running aground|ran aground|ran aground}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} For a vessel to be immobilized by water too shallow to allow it to float.
#* ''The ship '''ran aground''' and had to be towed back out to sea.''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To cause a vessel to run aground.
#* ''The drunken [[helmsman]] '''ran''' the ship '''aground.'''''

====Synonyms====
* [[ground]]

